sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant WS as WebSocket Manager
    participant MSG as Message Service
    participant CASS as Cassandra
    participant MQ as Kafka Queue
    participant DW as Delivery Worker
    participant REG as Session Registry
    participant WS2 as Recipient WS Manager
    participant R as Recipient Client

    Note over C,R: Send Message Flow

    C->>WS: send_message(conv_id, content, client_msg_id)
    activate WS
    
    WS->>WS: Validate auth & rate limit
    WS->>MSG: createMessage(sender, conv, content)
    activate MSG
    
    MSG->>MSG: Generate TIMEUUID message_id
    MSG->>CASS: INSERT INTO messages
    activate CASS
    CASS-->>MSG: success
    deactivate CASS
    
    MSG->>MQ: publish(delivery_task)
    MSG-->>WS: {messageId, status: "sent", timestamp}
    deactivate MSG
    
    WS-->>C: ack(messageId, "sent")
    deactivate WS

    Note over MQ,R: Asynchronous Delivery

    MQ->>DW: consume(delivery_task)
    activate DW
    
    DW->>REG: lookup(recipient_user_id)
    activate REG
    REG-->>DW: {ws_server: "ws2", devices: [...]}
    deactivate REG
    
    alt Recipient Online
        DW->>WS2: push(message)
        activate WS2
        WS2->>R: new_message(message)
        R-->>WS2: client_ack
        WS2-->>DW: delivered
        deactivate WS2
        
        DW->>MSG: updateStatus("delivered")
        MSG-->>WS: push(status_update)
        WS-->>C: message_delivered(messageId)
    else Recipient Offline
        DW->>MQ: enqueue(offline_queue:{user_id})
        DW->>DW: Trigger push notification
    end
    deactivate DW

    Note over C,R: Read Receipt Flow

    R->>WS2: read_ack(conversation_id, last_message_id)
    activate WS2
    WS2->>MSG: markAsRead(user, conv, message_id)
    activate MSG
    MSG->>MSG: Update read status in Redis
    MSG->>REG: lookup(sender_user_id)
    MSG-->>WS: push(read_receipt)
    deactivate MSG
    WS-->>C: message_read(messageId, readBy, readAt)
    deactivate WS2
